            "__resolveType": "site/sections/OpinionSection.tsx",
            "name": "Cibelle Higino",
            "text": "<p><em>\"The Venture Capital market in Brazil is still young compared to the rest of the financial market, but it has been growing and evolving very rapidly in recent years. This creates a challenge for VC analysts - while demanding complex skills and knowledge, there is no playbook on building a VC career. This report was born to highlight the main factors that affect professional growth, going far beyond compensation. We consider ourselves the first generation of VC analysts in Brazil and understand the industry's impact on the country; thus, we hope to create the foundation for these professionals to develop in the best possible way.\"</em></p>",
